   "result": "DAYS = [31, 28, 31, 30, 31, 30, 31, 31, 30, 31, 30, 31]\n\n\ndef _ordinal(s):\n    y, m, d = map(int, s.split('-'))\n    return y * 365 + sum(DAYS[: m - 1]) + d\n\n\ndef days_between(a, b):\n    return _ordinal(b) - _ordinal(a)\n"
